# Powerful PRO — muhit o'zgaruvchilari NAMUNASI (haqiqiy qiymatlarni bu faylga YOZMANG).
# Netlify: Site configuration → Environment variables (yoki `netlify env:set NOMI qiymat`).

# Supabase loyiha manzili (Settings → API → Project URL). Yangi o'rnatishda MAJBURIY.
SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co

# Supabase service_role kaliti (Settings → API → service_role). FAQAT serverda (Netlify) turadi.
# Hech qachon js/ fayllariga, GitHub'ga yoki chatga qo'ymang.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Brauzer uchun ochiq kalit (Settings → API → anon public) — faqat `npm run setup` uchun kerak,
# u js/config.js ga yoziladi.
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# GitHub Actions avtomatik deploy uchun (repo → Settings → Secrets):
# NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN, NETLIFY_SITE_ID
